{"id":"al_bom","lemma":"альбом","pos":"noun","rank":1963,"glosses":["album"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"альбома","plural":"альбомы"},"examples":[{"text":"Вот мой альбом.","en":"Here's my album.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Люблю этот альбом.","en":"I love this album.","words":[{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"this/that one"},null]},{"text":"У меня есть все ваши альбомы.","en":"I have all your albums.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Он показал мне свой альбом.","en":"He showed me his album.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to show","l":"показать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"one's own"},null]},{"text":"Том выпустил три альбома.","en":"Tom has put out three albums.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to let out","l":"выпустить"},{"g":"three"},null]}]}